<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>范围边界与不予承诺</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>04 · Requirements</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 44, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>以下 11 项明确排除在验收范围外，答辩不得宣称已完成</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 360, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', gap: 12, marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 370, height: 350, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· 真实厂商 API Key 缺失，仅用本机模拟端点验证</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· DemoProvider 为规则化应答，不是大模型推理</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· 课程记忆为全文拼接，非 RAG / 向量检索</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· 仅高等数学上册为完整 7 章结构化数据</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· ESP32 未实机联调，不承诺物理声光效果</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· 课程资料无删除入口，后端无 DELETE 路由</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 370, height: 350, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· /api/agent/* 公网配置接口未加鉴权</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· 无登录与权限，按单机单用户原型说明</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· 部署整目录上传会覆盖线上 SQLite 数据</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· GitHub 远端可能落后于本地与线上</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>· 语音输入依赖浏览器 Web Speech API</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 380, height: 300, background: '#1E4FA8', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 30, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>不画大饼</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>需求文档第 11 章逐项列出现状与影响；F37 硬件联动标注「可选 · 未实机 · 不列入验收」。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.5, margin: 0, marginTop: 16 }}>未实现、未实测、依赖外部条件的能力，一律不作为验收项。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 10 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 46, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>诚实报告局限，比藏着更专业；这一页本身就是「不画大饼」的证明。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>21 / 22</Text></Box></Slide>